# Keep local env / secret files out of the published images.
# Both Dockerfile and Dockerfile.web use `COPY . .`, so without these exclusions
# a populated .env would bake a developer's real secrets into the PUBLIC image.
# The committed *.env.example templates are re-included by the negations below.
.env
*.env
.env.*
**/*.env
**/.env.*
!*.env.example
!**/*.env.example
